{
  "name": "std-vote",
  "description": "std-vote — forum-style up/down vote tally with single-vote-per-user constraint. Owns a Vote entity, rebindable so a host orbital can target its own entity in place of Vote. VOTE carries the targetId being voted on and persists it plus the new direction onto that row (toggling to none when re-clicking the active arrow), emitting VoteCasted -> external so sibling traits can react. SET_VOTE_TARGET rebinds the trait to a new targetId and refetches scoped to it, mirroring std-browse's REFETCH_FILTER.",
  "level": "atom",
  "topic": "ui/core",
